[node name="HelpDialog" type="AcceptDialog" parent="." unique_id=2128590295]
unique_name_in_owner = true
title = "How to play"
ok_button_text = "Got it"
dialog_text = "1. Free drones already fly to the supply depot and earn credits.

2. Press and hold on your base (mouse or finger), draw a path
and release it on the enemy HQ, depot or an air-defense site.

3. Press + NEW ASSEMBLY LINE (top right). Pick a frame, then a warhead and
modules (hover any of them to see why you would take it) and create the line.
Every new region brings a new frame with its own modules. Drag the line onto a route arrow and press START.
The coloured text under each line says what it is doing or what it needs.

4. Every modular drone costs credits. The RESERVE keeps savings safe.

5. Air defense: guns (beat them with Maneuver/Armor), missiles (Decoy Flares),
jammers (EW Pod). Mountains block their view. The enemy adapts to your
favourite build and route.

On the planet, drag empty space to turn the globe; the wheel zooms.

6. HUNTERS fly at your base (red pulsing rings). Click/tap them to shoot
them down (+credits). If they arrive they knock out a line and steal 30%
of your credits. Base air defense only cripples and slows them.

Goal: destroy the Enemy HQ. It repairs 1% HP per second — attack with several lines.
Hover any button or number for a tip. Click a target for its key facts.

Space — pause · Esc — cancel drawing / close editor · Right click — cancel."

